  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "2. In a large bowl, whisk together jerk seasoning, olive oil, and lime juice.",
    "3. Cut tofu into 1-inch cubes and add to the bowl, tossing to coat.",
    "4. Alternate adding tofu, bell pepper, and onion to the skewers.",
    "5. Brush the grill with olive oil to prevent sticking.",
    "6. Grill skewers for 8-10 minutes, turning occasionally, until tofu is golden brown and vegetables are tender.",
    "7. Remove from heat and serve immediately."
